{"type":"standard","title":"Carmela Conroy","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Carmela Conroy</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q137216375","titles":{"canonical":"Carmela_Conroy","normalized":"Carmela Conroy","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Carmela Conroy</span></span>"},"pageid":81626642,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/31/Carmela_Conroy_State_Department_Portrait_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Carmela_Conroy_State_Department_Portrait_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":440},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/31/Carmela_Conroy_State_Department_Portrait_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":1288,"height":1718},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1378811974","tid":"20637c9a-c154-11f1-ae11-a94f09eff2bf","timestamp":"2026-10-06T07:04:09Z","description":"American diplomat","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carmela_Conroy","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carmela_Conroy?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carmela_Conroy?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Carmela_Conroy"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carmela_Conroy","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Carmela_Conroy","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carmela_Conroy?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Carmela_Conroy"}},"extract":"Carmela A. Conroy is an American diplomat, politician, and former career Foreign Service officer whose 25-year diplomatic career included postings across Asia, Europe, and the Pacific. She served as the U.S. Consul General in Lahore, Pakistan, during the 2011 Raymond Davis incident, a diplomatic crisis between the United States and Pakistan.","extract_html":"<p><b>Carmela A. Conroy</b> is an American diplomat, politician, and former career Foreign Service officer whose 25-year diplomatic career included postings across Asia, Europe, and the Pacific. She served as the U.S. Consul General in Lahore, Pakistan, during the 2011 Raymond Davis incident, a diplomatic crisis between the United States and Pakistan.</p>"}